  <h4>DO and DOES come FIRST in yes/no questions</h4>
  <div class="formula"><em>Do</em> + I/you/we/they + verb...? — <em>Does</em> + he/she/it + verb...?<span>After DOES, the verb has NO -s → Does she work? ✓ (NOT Does she works? ✗)</span></div>
  <div class="grammar-grid">
    <div class="grammar-rule">
      <span class="rule-label">Yes/No Questions</span>
      <div class="rule-text">
        <em>Do</em> you like coffee?<br>→ Yes, I <em>do</em>. / No, I <em>don't</em>.<br><br>
        <em>Does</em> she work here?<br>→ Yes, she <em>does</em>. / No, she <em>doesn't</em>.
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="grammar-rule">
      <span class="rule-label">WH- Questions</span>
      <div class="rule-text">
        <em>Where</em> do you live?<br>
        <em>What</em> does she do? (job)<br>
        <em>When</em> do you wake up?<br>
        <em>Why</em> does he study English?<br>
        <em>How</em> do you get to work?<br>
        <em>Who</em> do you live with?
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

