  <div class="callout callout-lila"><span class="callout-emoji">✍️</span><div><strong>Include at least:</strong><p>✦ Who you are (BE) &nbsp; ✦ Your family (have) &nbsp; ✦ Your job/studies &nbsp; ✦ Your home (there is/are) &nbsp; ✦ Your hobbies (enjoy + -ing) &nbsp; ✦ Your food preferences &nbsp; ✦ Your health habits &nbsp; ✦ Frequency adverbs (always/usually/sometimes/never) &nbsp; ✦ One negative sentence &nbsp; ✦ One question you like to ask other people</p></div></div>
