<div class="reflect-box">
  <h3>Present Simple — What I can do now 🌟</h3>
  <p class="reflect-rs">Click each item to tick it off. Be honest with yourself!</p>
  <div class="reflect-item" onclick="tickReflect(this)"><span>☐</span> I can use AM / IS / ARE correctly in sentences.</div>
  <div class="reflect-item" onclick="tickReflect(this)"><span>☐</span> I can conjugate regular verbs and add -s/-es/-ies for he/she/it.</div>
