<div class="score-card">
  <h3>Your Session Score 🏆</h3>
  <p>Based on exercises you checked and items you completed</p>
  <div class="score-display" id="finalScore">—<span style="font-size:16px"> pts</span></div>
  <div style="margin-top:16px;"><button class="btn btn-lila" onclick="showFinalScore()">Calculate my score ✨</button></div>
</div>

<div style="text-align:center;padding:28px 0 0;">
  <p style="font-family:'Caveat',cursive;font-size:28px;color:var(--lila-deep);">You're doing amazing. Keep going! 💜</p>
  <p style="font-size:13px;color:var(--gray);margin-top:8px;">My English Journey — A1 Present Simple Workbook</p>
</div>

